    <node id="&quot;BEYOND MEASURE (JEREMY CAMP ALBUM)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Beyond Measure is the fifth album by Jeremy Camp, released on October 31, 2006, and includes singles such as 'Tonight', 'What It Means', and 'Let It Fade'."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273</data>
